1
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:08,240
Help! Gandalf! Come on, help me!

2
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:18,800
Pippin! Who will I talk to?

3
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:33,920
Look at me.

4
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:42,680
Gandalf, forgive me. What did you see?

5
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,160
A tree.

6
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:52,860
There was a white tree in
the courtyard of Stone.

7
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:56,840
It was dead.

8
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:06,100
I said he was burning. Minas
Tirith, is that what you saw?

9
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,080
I saw.

10
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:13,880
I saw him.
